<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
  <title>Una Domanda Speciale 💖</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;600;700&family=Sacramento&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; }
    
    body { 
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff5f5 0%, #ffe3e8 50%, #f7d6e0 100%); 
      min-height: 100vh; 
      display: flex; 
      align-items: center; 
      justify-content: center; 
      padding: 15px; 
      color: #5c3d46; 
      text-align: center;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    .progress-bar { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 6px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff8fa3, #ff4d6d); }
    
    .glass-card { 
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9); 
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px); 
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border: 2px solid white; 
      border-radius: 28px; 
      padding: 30px 20px; 
      width: 100%; 
      max-width: 400px; 
      box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(220, 100, 130, 0.15); 
      position: relative; 
    }

    .emoji { font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    h2 { font-family: 'Sacramento', cursive; font-size: 2.7rem; color: #ff4d6d; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    p { font-size: 0.95rem; color: #6c4b55; margin-bottom: 25px; }
    
    .buttons { 
      display: flex; 
      gap: 10px; 
      justify-content: center; 
      align-items: center; 
      min-height: 140px; 
      position: relative; 
    }
    
    .btn-yes { 
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff4d6d, #d81159); 
      color: white; 
      padding: 14px 28px; 
      border-radius: 30px; 
      text-decoration: none; 
      font-weight: 700; 
      font-size: 1rem; 
      box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(255, 77, 109, 0.3);
      display: inline-block;
      touch-action: manipulation;
    }

    .btn-no { 
      background: rgba(180, 180, 190, 0.6); 
      color: #444; 
      padding: 12px 20px; 
      border-radius: 30px; 
      border: none; 
      font-size: 0.88rem; 
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer; 
      transition: transform 0.15s ease-out; 
      touch-action: manipulation;
      user-select: none;
      -webkit-user-select: none;
    }

    @media (max-width: 360px) {
      h2 { font-size: 2.3rem; }
      .glass-card { padding: 25px 15px; }
      .btn-yes { padding: 12px 22px; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="progress-bar"></div>
  <main class="glass-card">
    <div class="emoji">💌</div>
    <h2>Vuoi essere la mia ragazza? ❤️</h2>
    <p>C'è solo una risposta giusta qui sotto! 😉</p>

    <div class="buttons">
      <a href="/festa" class="btn-yes">Sì, lo voglio! 🥰✨</a>
      <button class="btn-no" id="btn-no">No 😜</button>
    </div>
  </main>

